A match in Lamark is missing an exhaustive arm. Complete it without using a wildcard if possible:

```rust
enum Tier {
    S,
    M,
    L,
    XS,
}

fn label(tier: Tier) -> &'static str {
    match tier {
        Tier::S => "verified",
        Tier::M => "experimental",
        Tier::L => "experimental",
    }
}
```

Add the missing `XS` arm so the match is exhaustive:

```rust
fn label(tier: Tier) -> &'static str {
    match tier {
        Tier::S => "verified",
        Tier::M => "experimental",
        Tier::L => "experimental",
        Tier::XS => "experimental",
    }
}
```

