Rewrite this Lamark-style code to avoid a nested `if` and use inline formatting:

if let Some(profile) = user_profile {
    if profile.is_active() {
        let msg = format!("profile {} is active", profile.name());
        send(msg);
    }
}

Collapse the condition and inline the format args:

if let Some(profile) = user_profile && profile.is_active() {
    let msg = format!("profile {} is active", profile.name());
    send(msg);
}

If `profile.name()` can be used inline, prefer `format!("profile {} is active", profile.name())` or `format!("profile {name} is active")` with a local binding.

